  "title": "snort: Move alerts to reassembled frame once",
  "description": "It doesn't make sense to move all the alerts for the current frame\ninto the reassembled from inside a loop over all the alerts, as that\nseems needlessly O(N^2). Move it outside the loop and the\nsnort_show_alert static function.\n\nThis also saves on a tree lookup that was just repeating what was done,\nand hence never NULL but made Coverity worry it might be NULL because\nwe usually check tree lookups.\n\nCoverity CID 1400462",
